hadiths[73]{hadithnumber,text}:
"544","Eid key liye pedal jana aur nikalney sey pehley kuchh kha lena sunnat hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- aksar ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai wo mustahab samajhtey hain ke aadmi eid key liye pedal jaey aur Eid-Ul-Fitr ki namaz key liye nikalney sey pehley kuchh kha le. 3- mustahab ye hai ke aadmi bila uzr sawar ho kar na jaey."
"545","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam aur abu-Bakar aur umr Raziallahu anhuma eidain ki namaz khutbe sey pehley padhtey aur uskey baad khutba detey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Jabir aur ibne-Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai ke eidain ki namaz khutbe sey pehley hogi. 4- aur kaha jata hai ke sab sey pehley jisney namaz sey pehley khutba diya wo Marwan bin Hakam tha."
"546","Mainey Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath Eidain ki namaz eik aur do sey ziyada baar yani mutaaddid (bahutsi) baar baghair Azan aur baghair iqaamat key padhi hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Jabir bin Samra (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Jabir bin Abdullah aur ibne-Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey hadeesen aai hain. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm ka amal isi par hai ke Eidain ki namaz key liye Azan nahin di jaeygi aur na nawaafil mein sey kisi key liye."
"547","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam eidain aur Jume mein (سبح اسم ربك الأعلى) aur (هل أتاك حديث الغاشية) padhtey they, aur kabhi-kabhi dono eik hi din mein aa padtey to bhi unhi dono Suraton ko padhtey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Noman bin Bashir Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein abu Waqid , Samura bin Jundub aur ibne-Abbas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- aur isi tarah Sufiyan Sory aur Musa'ir ney bhi Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Muntashir sey Abu Awaana ki hadees ki tarah riwayat ki hai. 4- rahey Sufiyan bin Uena to un sey riwayat mein ikhtilaf paya jata hai. un ki eik sanad yun hai : (عن إبراهيم بن محمد بن المنتشر an أبيه an حبيب بن سالم an أبيه an النعمان بن بشير) aur ham Habib bin Salim ki kisi aisi riwayat ko nahin jantey jisey unhoney apney walid sey riwayat ki ho. Habib bin Salim Noman bin Bashir key azad karda ghulam hain, unhoney Noman bin Bashir sey kaee ahadees riwayat ki hain. aur ibne Uena sey Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Muntashir ke wastey sey un logon ki tarah bhi riwayat ki gaee hai padhi. aur Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ye bhi marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke aap eidain ki namaz mein « sura Qaaf » aur «Sura Qamar » padhtey they padhi. aur yehi Shafai bhi kehtey hain."
"548","umr bin Khattab ney Abu Waqid Laisi Haris bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha : Eidul-Fitra aur Eidul-Azhaa mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam kya padhtey they? unhoney kaha : aap Sura Qaaf aur Sura Qamar padhtey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"549","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat farmaya: \Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne safar mein nikal kar unees (19) din do raka'at namaaz padhi.\"" Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) ne farmaya: \""Pir hum jab kisi jagah unees (19) din thehte to hum do raka'at namaaz padhte.\"""""""
"550","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Eidain mein pehli rakat mein qirat sey pehley saat aur dusri rakat mein qirat sey pehley paanch takbeerein kahin. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is baab mein Aaisha , ibne-Umar aur Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 2- Kasir ke dada ki hadees Hasan hai aur ye sab sey achchhi riwayat hai jo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey is baab mein riwayat ki gaee hai. padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, 4- aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke unhoney Madiney mein isi tarah ye namaz padhi , 5- aur yehi ehale Madina ka bhi qol hai, aur yehi Malik bin Anas , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi kehtey hain, 6- Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai ke unhoney Eidain ki takbeeron key barey mein kaha hai ke ye no takbeerein hain. pehli rakat mein qirat sey pehley paanch takbeerein kahey padhi. aur dusri rakat mein pehley qirat karey phir rukoo ki takbir key sath chaar takbeerein kahey padhi. kaee Sahaba kiram sey bhi isi tarah ki riwayat marvi (riwayat hui) hai. ehle-koofa ka bhi qol yehi hai aur yehi Sufiyan Sory bhi kehtey hain."
"551","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam Eidul-Fitr ke din nikley, aap ney do rakat namaz padhi, phir aap ney na is sey pehley koi namaz padhi aur na uskey baad. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ibne-Abbas ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin umr , Abdullah bin Amr aur abu-Saeed sey bhi ahadees aai hain, padhi. 3- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, aur yehi Shafai , Ahmed , aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi kehtey hain, 4- aur Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey ehle-ilm key eik giroh ka khayal hai ke Eidain ki namaz ke pehley aur uskey baad namaz padh saktey hain lekin pehla qol ziyada sahih hai."
"552","wo eid key din nikley to unhoney na is sey pehley koi namaz padhi aur na uskey baad aur zikr kiya ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney aisey hi kiya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"553","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam Eidain mein kanwari ladkiyon,parda nasheen aur haaiza aurton ko bhi ley jatey they. albatta haaiza aurten Eid-gaah sey door rehti aur musalmanon ki dua mein shareek rehti. eik aurat ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! agar kisi aurat key paas chadar na ho to kya karey?  aap ney farmaya : ''uski behan ko chahiye ke usey apni chaadaron mein sey koi chadar udhaar  dedey.''"
"554","Umme Atiya (Raziallahu Anha) sey isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Umme Atiya (Raziallahu Anha) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Abbas aur Jabir (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm isi hadees ki taraf gaey hain aur Eidain key liye aurton ko nikalney ki rukhsat (choot) di hai, aur baaz ney isey makrooh jana hai. 4- Abdullah bin Mubarak kehtey hain ke aaj kal mein Eidain mein aurton key janey ko makrooh samajhta hun, agar koi aurat na maaney aur nikalney hi par ba-zid ho to chahiye ke uska shohar usey puraney maile kapdon mein nikalney ki ijazat dey aur wo zeenat na karey. aur agar wo is tarah nikalney par razi na ho to phir shohar ko haq hai ke wo usey nikalney sey rok dey. 5- Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey naqal kiya hai ke agar Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam un naee chizon ko dekh letey jo ab aurton ney nikal rakhi hain to unhen masjid janey sey mana farma detey jaisey Bani-Israel ki aurton ko mana kar diya gaya tha. 6- Sufiyan Sory sey bhi naqal kiya gaya hai ke aaj kal key daur mein unhoney bhi aurton ka Eid key liye nikalna makrooh qarar diya."
"555","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab Eid key din eik raastey sey nikaltey to doosrey sey wapis aatey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin umr aur abu-Raafey (Raziallauh anhum) sey hadeesen aai hain. 3- Abu-Tameela aur Yunus bin Muhammad ney ye hadees b-tareeq : « Fulaih bin Suleman, an Saeed bin al-Haaris, an Jabir bin Abdullah» ki hai. 4- baaz ehle-ilm ney is hadees ki perwi mein Imam key liye mustahab qarar diya hai ke jab eik raastey sey jaey to doosrey sey wapis aaye. Shafai ka yehi qol hai, aur Jabir ki hadees (ba-muqabla abu-Huraira) goya ziyada sahih hai."
"556","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam eidul-Fitr key din jab tak kha na letey nikaltey nahin they aur eidul-Azha key din jab tak namaz na padh letey khatey na they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Barida bin haseeb Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees gharib hai, 2- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain ke sawab bin Utba ki uskey ilawa koi hadees mujhey nahin malum , padhi. 3- is bab mein Ali aur Anas Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 4- baaz ehle-ilm ney mustahab qarar diya hai ke aadmi eidul-Fitr ki namaz key liye kuch khaye baghair na nikley aur uskey liye mustahab ye hai ke wo khajoor padhi. ka nashta karey aur eidul-Azha key din na khaye jab tak ke lot kar na aa jaey ."
"557","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam eidul-Fitr key din namaz key liye nikalney sey pehley chand khajuren kha letey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib sahih hai."
"558","Hisham bin Ishaq — aur woh Abdullah bin Kinanah ke vanshavali se tha — apne pita (ki rivayat) se yeh kah ke: \Al-Walid bin Uqbah...\"""""""
"559","aagey unhoney isi tarah zikr kya albatta is mein unhoney lafz « منخشعاً » ka izafa kya hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- aur yehi Shafai ka qol hai, wo kehtey hain ke namaz istisqaa eidain ki namaz ki tarah padhi jaeygi . pehli rakat mein saat takbeerein aur dusri mein paanch , aur unhoney ibne-Abbas ki hadees sey istidlaal kya hai, 3- Malik bin Anas sey marvi hai wo kehtey hain ke istisqaa mein eidain ki namaz ki takbeeron ki tarah takbeerein nahin kaheyga , 4- abu-Hanifa Noman kehtey hain ke istisqaa ki koi namaz nahin padhi jaeygi aur na main unhen chadar palatney hi ka hukm deta hun, balke sarey log eik sath dua kerengey aur lot ayengey , 5- unka ye qol sunnat key mukhalif hai."
"560","Ibn Abbas (Razi Allah unhu) ne riwayat farmayi: \Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne kusuf ki namaz padhi. Aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne tilawat ki...\"""""""
"561","Aishah (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zameen mein suraj ka kusuf (eclipse) ho chuka tha.\"""""""
"562","Samurah bin Jundah (rzy allh anh) nay rwayt ky kh: \pyghmbr sly allh alyh wslm nay grhn kay mwqa pr hmyn nmaz prhayy؛ hm nhyn sma kh aap ka swt sma kr sktay thay۔\"""""""
"563","Abū Bakr Muḥammad ibn Abān ne ḥum ko ḥadīth bayān kī, Ibrāhīm ibn Ṣadaqah ne ḥum ko ḥadīth bayān kī, Sufyān ibn Ḥusayn se riwāyat karte huye, al-Zuhrī se, ʿUrwah se, ʿĀʾishah (Raziyallāhu ʿanhā) se riwāyat karte huye ke Nabī (Ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne Ṣalāt al-Kusūf adā kī aur us mein ẓabānī qirāʾat farmāʾī.\n\nAbū ʿĪsā ne farmāyā: Ye ḥasan ḥadīth hai. Abū Isḥāq al-Fazārī ne Sufyān ibn Ḥusayn se is jaisī riwāyat kī hai. Ye ḥadīth Mālik ibn Anas, Aḥmad aur Isḥāq (Rahimahumullāh) ke qaul bunyād hai."
"564","Salim ne apne father se riwayat ki: \Nabi (peace be upon him) ne Salat al-Khawf ada ki.\"""""""
"565","Sahl bin Abi Hathmah ne Salat al-Khawf ke baare mein farmaya ke: Imam Qiblah ki taraf muntazir khada hota hai aur un mein se ek giroh uske saath khada hota hai."
"566","(Abu Eisa ne farmaya:) Muhammad bin Bash-har ne kaha: \Main ne Yahya bin Sa'eed se (joh rivayat karne walon mein nambar 565 mein hain) is Hadees ke baare mein poocha. To unhone mujhe Shu'bah se yeh rivayat sunayi."""""
"567","Hadith ka Ilmi Urdu Tarjuma\n\nYeh hadith Malik ibn Anas ne riwayat ki hai, Yazid ibn Ruman se, Saleh ibn Khawwat se, aur un shakhs se jo Nabi ﷺ ke saath Salat al-Khawf (Khauf ki Namaz) padha tha, aur unhone pahle riwayat jaisa hi zikr kiya.\n\nAbu Isa (Tirmizi) ne farmaya: \Yeh hadith hasan sahih hai.\""\n\nUnhone yeh bhi farmaya: \""Is par Malik"","" Shafai"","" Ahmad"","" aur Ishaq ka amal hai.\""\n\nYeh hadith ek se zyada riwayaton se bhi mili hai ke Nabi ﷺ ne do girohon mein se ek giroh ke saath ek ek rakat padhi"","" yani Nabi ﷺ ne do rakatein ada ki jabke har giroh ne ek ek rakat ada ki.\n\nAbu Isa (Tirmizi) ne farmaya: \""Abu Ayyaash Zuraqi — unka naam Zaid ibn Samit hai.\""\n\n\n\n*Yeh riwayat Salat al-Khawf (Khauf ki Namaz) ke tareeqe se mutalliq hai"","" jo khatre ya jang ke waqt padhi jaati hai"","" aur yeh chaar bade Imam ke fiqhi masail par unke amal ka zahir karti hai.*"""""
"568","Abu Ad-Darda (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Maine Rasoolullah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ke saath gyarah sajdey (tilawat ke) kiye."""""
"569","Abu Ad-Darda (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Mainey Rasoolullah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ke saath gyarah sajdey kiye.\"""""""
"570","Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\nNusayr ibn 'Alī ne riwayat ki, unhone 'Īsā ibn Yūnus se, unhone al-A'mash se, aur unhone Mujāhid se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya:\n\n\Hum Ibn 'Umar (raziyallāhu 'anhumā) ki khidmat mein tō thē"","" tō unhōnē farmayā: Rasūlullāh (sallallāhu 'alayhi wa sallam) nē farmayā: 'Auraton ko rāt kō masājid jāne kī ijāzat dō.'\n\nTō unkē betā (rahimahullāh) nē kahā: 'Wallāh"","" hum unhen ijāzat nahīṅ dēṅgē"","" isliyē kahīṅ is sē woh dhokē (aur fasaād) kā zariyā na ban jāēṅ.'\n\nIbn 'Umar (raziyallāhu 'anhumā) nē phir farmayā: 'Allāh tumhē aisā karē! Main kahāṅ kah rahā hōṅ kē Rasūlullāh (sallallāhu 'alayhi wa sallam) nē farmayā"","" aur tum kah rahē hō kē \""Hum unhen ijāzat nahīṅ dēṅgē\""?!'\""\n\nQā'il nē kahā: \""Is bāb mēṅ (aur bhī riwayātēṅ haiṅ) Abū Hurayrah"","" Zaynab — 'Abdullāh ibn Mas'ūd kī bīvī — aur Zayd ibn Khālid (raziyallāhu 'anhum jamī'an) sē.\""\n\nAbū 'Īsā (al-Tirmidhī) nē farmayā: \""Ibn 'Umar kī hadīth Hasan Sahīh (hasan aur sahīh) hadīth hai.\""\n\n\n\n*Yeh hadīth Jāmi' al-Tirmidhī mēṅ darj hai aur al-Bukhārī aur Muslim kē majmū'ōṅ mēṅ bhī maujūd hai. Yeh auraton kō masājid mēṅ sharakēt kī — khās taur par rāt kē waqt — jawāz sābit kartī hai"","" jōṅkē Sāhabā (raziyallāhu 'anhum) kē andāz-e-fikr bhī zāhir kartī hai kē ādāb-o-ahkām kī hifāzat rakhnē kē liyē woh hamesha hoshiyār rahēṅ.*"""""
"571","Tariq bin Abdullah Al-Muharibi (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \جب تم نماز میں ہو تو اپنے دائیں طرف نہ تھوکو۔\"""""""
"572","Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke: Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \مسجد میں تھوک نکالنا گناہ ہے۔\"""""""
"573","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah Anhu) ne riwayat ki: \Hum Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath do suraton mein sajdah kiya: 'Apne Rub ke naam se padh' (Surah Al-Alaq) aur 'Jab aasmaan phat jaye' (Surah Al-Inshiqaq).\"""""""
"574","(Ek dosri sanad mein) Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is tarah hi riwayat ki."
"575","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn: \rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay as (swrt) myn sjdh kya، yany swrt alnjm، awr mslmanwn nay bhy (why) kya۔\"""""""
"576","Zaid bin Thabit (رضي الله عنه) ne rivayat farmaya: \n\Main ne Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ke hazoor mein Surah An-Najm tilawat ki.\"""""""
"577","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn:\n\n\mynay rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) kw swrt s myn sjdh krtay dykha\""\n\nhzrt abn abas (rzy allh anh) nay frmaya: \""yh az sjdh tlawt myn say nhyn hay۔\"""""""
"578","Uqbah bin Amir (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: Maine kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah! Surah Al-Hajj ko do sajdey se azeem qarar diya gaya hai?\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Haan.\"""""""
"579","Al-Hasan bin Muhammad bin Ubaidullah bin Abi Yazid ne farmaya: Ibn Juraij ne mujh se kaha: Aye Hasan! Ubaidullah bin Abi Yazid ne mujhe ittila di ke Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: \Ek shakhs Nabi ﷺ ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha: 'Azeer-e-Ilaahi! Raat ko main ne apne ghar mein neend mein ek khwaab dekha jismein main ek darakht ke peeche namaz padh raha tha.'\"""""""
"580","Aisha (Allah us se razi ho) ne riwayat ki: \Jab Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) Quran ki tilawat ke liye sajdah karte the...\"""""""
"581","Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne farmaya: \جو شخص سو گیا...\"""""""
"582","Abu Horaira (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Kya us shakhs ko"","" jo imam se apna sar utha deta ho"","" is se nahi dost ke us ke sar ko Allah ta'ala gadhe ke sar kar de?\"""""""
"583","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay: \maaz bn jbl (rz all anh) mghrb ky nmaz rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) kay sath prhtay thay۔\"""""""
"584","Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay: \jb hm nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) kay pychhay zhr ky nmaz prhtay awr grmy shdyd hwty...\"""""""
"585","Jabir bin Samurah (radiAllahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ki: \Jab Nabi (sallAllahu alayhi wasallam) Fajr ki namaz ada farma lete"","" to yahan tak ki suraj chad jaaye"","" woh usi jagah baithe rehte jahan unhone namaz ada ki hoti.\"""""""
"586","Anas bin Malik (Razi Allah un par ho) ne riwayat ki ke: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jo shaks Fajr ki namaz jama'at ke saath padhe...\"""""""
"587","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (rzy allh anh) rwayt frmatay hyn:\n\n\rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nmaz kay dwran dayyn awr bayyn trf nzr krtay thay، lykn apny grdn pychhay ky trf nhyn ghwratay thay۔\"""""""
"588","Sa'eed bin Abi Hind ne Ikrimah (rhmh allh) kay ashab myn say ksy say rwayt ky kh: \nby krym ﷺ nmaz kay dwran ngah phyratay thay\"" awr anhwn nay asy trh ky ayk awr rwayt zkr ky۔"""""
"589","Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Rasoolullah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne mujh se farmaya: 'اے میرے بیٹے! نماز میں اِدھر اُدھر دیکھنے سے بچو۔'\"""""""
"590","Aishah (raziya Allahu anha) ne riwayat ki: \Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se namaz mein idhar udhar dekhne ke bare mein poocha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Yeh woh hissa hai jo Shaitan bandey ki namaz mein se chheen leta hai.'\"""""""
"591","Mu'adh bin Jabal (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi namaz (Salat) aaye aur imam kisi halat mein ho"","" toh uska saath imam ka hai.\"""""""
"592","Abdullah bin Abi Qatadah (rz all anh) apnay wald (rz all anh) say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \jb nmaz kay lyay aqamt khy jayay...\"""""""
"593","Ḥadīth Ka Tarjuma\n\nḤadīth Nambar — Dua-e-Tashahhud ke Bāre mein\n\nSanad (Irsal al-Ḥadīth):\n\nMaḥmūd ibn Ghaylān ne hamāre pās bayān kiyā — Yaḥyā ibn Ādam ne hamāre pās bayān kiyā — Abū Bakr ibn ʿAyyāsh ne hamāre pās bayān kiyā — ʿĀṣim se — Zirr se — ʿAbdullāh (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se, unhone kiyā:\n\n\n\nMatn (Ḥadīth ka Bayān):\n\nMain namāz paṛh rahā thā, aur Nabī Muḥammad (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam), Abū Bakr aur ʿUmar (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhumā) un ke pās the. Jab main [tashahhud mein] baithā, tō maine awwal Allāh kī taʿrīf aur taḥmīd se shurūʿ kiyā, phir Nabī (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) par ṣalawāt bhejā, phir maine keval apne liye dua kī. Tab Nabī (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā:\n\n> \Mangō"","" tumhe dē gā. Mangō"","" tumhe dē gā.\""\n\n*(Unhon ne yāh do bārs bayān farmāyā.)*\n\n\n\nWārid Ḥadīth ke Zikr:\n\nImam al-Tirmidhī ne farmāyā: Faḍālah ibn ʿUbayd (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se bhī is bāre mein ḥadīth wārid hai.\n\nImam Abū ʿĪsā al-Tirmidhī ne farmāyā: ʿAbdullāh ibn Masʿūd (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) kī ḥadīth ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ hai.\n\nUnhon ne yāh bhī farmāyā: Aḥmad ibn Ḕanbal ne Yaḥyā ibn Ādam se yāh ḥadīth mukhtaṣar sūrat mein bāndhī hai.\n\n\n\n*— Jāmiʿ al-Tirmidhī (Sunan al-Tirmidhī) se nikālā huā"","" Kitāb al-Ṣalāh (Namāz ki Kitāb)*"""""
"594","Aishah (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat ki: \Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke sabhi bastiyon (Dur) mein Masajid banai jayein aur unhein saaf suthra aur khushbu se araaya jaye.\"""""""
"595","Hummein Hannad ne riwayat ki, aur Abdah aur Waki' ne riwayat ki, unho ne Hisham ibn Urwah se riwayat ki, unho ne apne walid se riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukum diya, aur unhon ne isi tarah ka zikr farmaya. Abu Isa ne farmaya: Yeh hadith pehli hadith se zyada sahih hai."
"596","Hadees bayaan farmaaya gaya: Imaam Ibn Abi 'Umar ne hamaare saamne bayaan kiya, Sufyaan bin 'Uyaynah ne riwaayat kiya, Hishaam bin 'Urwah se, apne baare mein, ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne is jaisi cheez ka hukm aur zikr farmaaya. Sufyaan ne kaha: Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke \gharon mein masjids ki tameer\"" ke ibaarat qabaail ke hai."""""
"597","Ibn Umar (Razi Allah unho se) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Raat aur din ki Namaz do do rakat hain.\"""""""
"598","Hazrat Aasim bin Damrah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh hm nay hzrt aly krm allh wjhh say rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) ky dn ky nmaz kay baray myn swal kya۔ aap nay frmaya: \tm yh nhyn kr sktay۔\"" hm nay kha: \""jw kwyy myry taqt kay mtabq kr skay (wh kray ga)؟\"" tw aap nay frmaya: \""jb swrj as trf (mshrq) as trh nklay jysay yh asr kay wqt as trf (mghrb) nklta hay۔\"""""""
"599","Hadith ka Tarjumah (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\nHazrat 'Alī (RaziAllāhu Ta'ālā 'Anhu) se marfū' taur par, Nabī ﷺ se mansūsā rivāyat:\n\nMuḥammad ibn al-Muthannā ne hamain bayān farmāyā: Muḥammad ibn Ja'far ne hamain bayān farmāyā: Shu'bah ne hamain riwāyat kī, Abū Isḥāq se, 'Āṣim ibn Ḍamrah se, Hazrat 'Alī (RaziAllāhu Ta'ālā 'Anhu) se, aur Nabī ﷺ se isī ma'nā par rivāyat kī.\n\nAbū 'Īsā (Imām Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: *\Yeh ḥasan (achchī) hadīṡ hai.\""*\n\nIsḥāq ibn Ibrāhīm ne farmāyā: *\""Nabī ﷺ ke din ke nafal namāzon ke bāre mein jo sab se achchī rivāyat manqūl hai"","" yeh hai.\""*\n\nYeh riwāyat manqūl hai ke 'Abdullāh ibn al-Mubārak is hadīṡ ko ḍa'īf (kamzor) samajhte the.\n\nIs kamożī (weakness) kī wajah: Hamārā qayāl hai — aur Allāh Ta'ālā sab se behtar jāntā hai — is ko ḍa'īf is liye qarār diyā gayā kyunki is jaisī rivāyat Nabī ﷺ se illā is silsile ke tawassut se manqūl nahīṅ hotī"","" yanī 'Āṣim ibn Ḍamrah ke tariq se"","" Hazrat 'Alī (RaziAllāhu Ta'ālā 'Anhu) se.\n\n'Āṣim ibn Ḍamrah ko ba'ẓ 'ulamā-e-ḥadīṡ ne thiqah (bā-e'tibār) qarār diyā hai.\n\n'Alī ibn al-Madīnī ne farmāyā: Yaḥyā ibn Sa'īd al-Qaṭṭān ne riwāyat kī ke Sufyān (Thawrī) ne farmāyā: *\""Hum 'Āṣim ibn Ḍamrah kī hadīṡ kī al-Ḥārith kī hadīṡ par faẓīlat ko pahchānte the.\""*\n\n\n\n*Yeh riwāyat Sunan al-Tirmidhī mein wāqi' hai"","" jahān muṣannaf ne is kī sanad kī 'ilmī tashrīḥ kī hai"","" aur is par ba'ẓ muḥaqqiqīn kī qubūl aur ba'ẓ kī intiqād dono bayān farmāe"","" is kī tanhā silsile se rivāyat hone kī wajah se.*"""""
"600","Aishah (raziyaAllahu anha) ne riwayat farmaya: \Rasool Allah (sallAllahu alaihi wasallam) auraton ke libason (chadaron) par namaz nahi padhte the.\"""""""
"601","Urwah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh aayshh sdyqh (rzy allh anha) nay frmaya: \myn aayy awr as wqt rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) myn ghr myn nmaz prh rhay thay awr drwazh bnd tha۔ phr aap (sly allh alyh wslm) chl kr myray lyay drwazh khwla۔\"""""""
"602","Abu Wa'il ne kaha: \Ek shakhs ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (رضي الله عنہ) se is lafz ke baare mein poocha: 'Ghairi asin' ya 'Yasin'? To unhone kya: \""Kya tum Quran mukammal padh sakte ho siwaye is lafz ke?\"" Usne kaha: \""Jee haan.\"" Unhone kaha: \""Beshak ek qaum ise padhti hai...\"""""""
"603","Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anho) ne riwayat ki ke: \nNabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Jab koi aadmi wudu kare aur apna wudu achi tarah kare...\"""""""
"604","Sa'd bin Ishaq bin Ka'b bin Ujrah (raziyallahu anhum) ne apne baap se aur unke baap ne apne dada se riwayat ki keh:\n\n\Paighambar-e-Akram (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Masjid-e-Bani Abdul Ashbal mein Maghrib ki namaz padhi.\"""""""
"605","Qais bin Asim (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke unhon ne Islam qubool kiya aur Nabi Kareem (صلی اللہ علیہ والہ وسلم) ne unhe hukm diya ke pani aur sidr (ber ke pattay) se ghusl karein."
"606","Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (RaziAllahu Anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (SallAllahu Alayhi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Tumhare se aapse khoj khane ki jagah mein dakhil hotay waqt jinno ki aankhon aur aadmiyon ki aurat (satr) ke parday ke darmian 'Bismillah' (Allah ki naam ke saath) kehna hi chaahiye.\"""""""
"607","Abdullah bin Busr (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \qyamt kay dn۔\"""""""
"608","Aishah (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat ki: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) apne aap ko paak karte waqt (wuzu ya ghusl mein) seedha haath se shuru farmaana pasand farmate the.\"""""""
"609","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \mqbwl wzw dw rtl pany kay sath hwta hay۔\"""""""
"610","Ali bin Abi Talib (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya:"
"611","Shahr bin Hawshab ne farmaya: \Main ne Jarir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنہ) ko wudu karte aur apne khuff (mochon ke juton) par masah karte dekha.\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Main ne un se poocha: 'Yeh kya hai?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne Nabi Kareem (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ko wudu karte aur apne khuff par masah karte dekha.' Main ne un se kaha: 'Kya Al-Ma'idah ke pehle ya Al-Ma'idah ke baad?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne Islam qubool nahi kiya jab tak Al-Ma'idah nazil nahi hui.'\"""""""
"612","Shahr bin Hawshab ne kaha: (Zaniyad ki silsilah) Khalid bin Ziyad se is ke barabar hai."
"613","Ammar (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \n\Nabi (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم) ne junub shakhs ko khaana khaane ya sona chahte waqt ijazat di.\"""""""
"614","Ka'b bin Ujrah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki: \n\Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: 'Main Allah ki panah maangta hoon tere liye"","" aey Ka'b bin Ujrah! Un sardaaron ke baare mein jo mere baad aayenge. Jo shakhs unke darwaaze par aaye"","" jhoot ko sahmati de aur unke zulm mein unki madad kare.'\"""""""
"615","Hazrat Muhammad (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ibn Numair ne Ubaidullah bin Musa se riwayat ki.\"""""""
"616","Sulaim bin Amir ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Abu Umamah ko yeh kehte hue suna ke main ne Rasoolullah ﷺ ko Hajjatul-Wada' mein khutba dete hue suna."""""
